      "text": "Tiene un débil brillo rosado y debe llevarla Clamperl.\nSube la Defensa Especial.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Strumento da dare a Clamperl.\nSquama dai bagliori rosei che aumenta\nla Difesa Speciale.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An item to be held by Clamperl. This scale shines\nwith a faint pink and raises the holder’s\nSp. Def stat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "パールルに　持たせると\n特防が　あがる　ウロコ。\nうすい　ピンク色に　光る。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "让珍珠贝携带后，\n特防就会提高的鳞片。\n散发着淡淡的粉红色光芒。",
      "version_group": {
